ll restore %0.1f Equilibrium while in your own mucus, and other friendly creatures in your mucus will restore 1 Equilibrium both for you and for themselves.\n\t\tThe Poison damage and Equilibrium regeneration increase with your Mindpower, and laying down more mucus in the same spot will intensify its effects and refresh its duration.","source_tag":"tformat","target_preimage":"你开始在你经过或站立的地方滴落粘液，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t粘液每回合自动放置，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t技能等级达到 4 级或以上时，粘液会从放置位置扩展到半径 1 的范围。\n\t\t粘液会使所有经过的敌人中毒，每回合造成 %0.1f 自然伤害，持续 5 回合（可叠加）。\n\t\t站在自己的粘液上时，你每回合回复 %0.1f 失衡值。\n\t\t每个经过粘液的友方单位，每回合将和你一起回复 1 点失衡值。\n\t\t毒素伤害和失衡值回复受精神强度加成；在同一位置铺设更多粘液会强化其效果，并刷新持续时间。","target_preimage_sha256":"45f8926f95007d0421034a31933dd74efa05bb34684ff556be0fd2010601f3b1","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-c03b7552b4059d697ec0/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-c03b7552b4059d697ec0","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-c03b7552b4059d697ec0/manifest.json","observation_identity":"1846d27ffe93e124a6192bbf134be08fb4e23f72cb31ab1acda22b8709698061","publication_commit":"d6c6c00a9f935278e8f5fb4808d9460cf35352ff","result_sha256":"9099bfcedc465e9fb4144cc7c11de299366cd93655f80fcf44b22b0f9cec3783","results_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-c03b7552b4059d697ec0/results.jsonl"}},{"call_locator":"7d21467d6c7ee98dc25f75de77188abcd551d4e505c7bbd3e70396331e728ffe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fe42c359a5490ee337c6eb5084fb0103ac39e17315c25f59ef278b2823eceae5","fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","logical_entry_identity":"bf2ebf16d107db0d8d607ee728358100a31f327674fa4e1c7f2e7468a30c056f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","proposed_successor_input":{"call_locator":"7d21467d6c7ee98dc25f75de77188abcd551d4e505c7bbd3e70396331e728ffe","compo